        ],
        "text": "According to William H. Hurd, Virginia's cross\u2011burning statute criminalizes cross\u2011burning used to threaten bodily harm."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Michael R. Dreeben",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "12acea1412456b25fd6fb4ec3abd5ab0e4ff8d31e0c91b31deec1eda4079048e",
