            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 18,
              "start": 18
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Michael R. Dreeben, the statute is intended to prevent intimidation, as cross\u2011burning has historically been used as a tool of intimidation."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Smolla",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "12acea1412456b25fd6fb4ec3abd5ab0e4ff8d31e0c91b31deec1eda4079048e",
